<title>FRANCE: Axa sold 4 mln BNP shares.</title>
<headline>Axa sold 4 mln BNP shares.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four million shares held by French insurer Axa in Banque Nationale de Paris were sold on Thursday morning at a price of 220.5 francs per share, a BNP spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>BNP shares stood at 222.7 francs, down 0.45 percent at 1018 GMT, while Axa shares stood at 361.0 francs, up 0.92 percent.  </p>
<p>Axa held 14.5 percent of BNP to date and the spokeswoman said the transaction, representing 1.9 percent of BNP's capital, was handled by BNP itself, before the opening of the Paris stock market.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom 633 1 4221 5452</p>
